      "summary": "A new Uutissuomalainen poll showed Kokoomus support continuing to slide, with internal party sources giving candid assessments of Orpo's leadership challenges. A separate USU survey found Left Alliance's Minja Koskela rated the most successful party leader, while Orpo's ratings had declined from October 2025. IS Extra reporting cited anonymous insiders on the root causes."
    },
