      "headline": "Orpo condemns May Day protest violence; backs mask ban at demonstrations",
      "summary": "PM Orpo condemned a violent assault on a female protester in Tampere on May Day and expressed support for tightening the mask ban at public demonstrations. Interior Minister Rantanen (Finns Party) called for a broader mask ban in all public places; Orpo stopped at banning masks specifically at demonstrations."
