      "summary": "Former Labour Minister Arto Satonen published a book detailing his ministerial tenure, disclosing that Orpo called him during his mother's funeral to offer a cabinet post, and that breaking the tripartite labour negotiation model was a Kokoomus objective from the outset of coalition negotiations. Satonen also denied the party acted solely on behalf of the EK employers' federation."
    },
